{
  "id": "30cYjy7_DDg",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.21,
      "end": 10.34,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Do you know when brown kids get slapped? Every brown birthday party.",
          "start": 0.21,
          "end": 4.21
        },
        {
          "text": "And usually it's the kid whose birthday it is, and we stand there and point and laugh.",
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 10.34
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "brown kids",
          "ko": "(남아시아계) 갈색 피부 아이들",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 10.43,
      "end": 17.18,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "We go, \"Ah, Biju got slapped on his birthday!\"",
          "start": 10.43,
          "end": 13.64
        },
        {
          "text": "And that's what makes us tough and resilient.",
          "start": 13.72,
          "end": 17.18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.77,
      "end": 23.98,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "It's why we become cardiologists and win spelling bees.",
          "start": 17.77,
          "end": 20.65
        },
        {
          "text": "Slapping is important. It elevates your game.",
          "start": 21.35,
          "end": 23.98
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "resilient",
          "ko": "회복력 있는, 강인한",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "cardiologists",
          "ko": "심장 전문의",
          "type": "word"
        },
        {
          "term": "spelling bees",
          "ko": "영어 철자 맞히기 대회",
          "type": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "term": "elevates your game",
          "ko": "실력·수준을 끌어올리다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 25.78,
      "end": 29.61,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You ever seen an Indian kid win a spelling bee?",
          "start": 25.78,
          "end": 27.99
        },
        {
          "text": "Incredible!",
          "start": 28.07,
          "end": 29.61
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 37.75,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Ice water in the veins.",
          "start": 30.7,
          "end": 33.16
        },
        {
          "text": "That kid won't choke on camera. He's been slapped on camera.",
          "start": 34.74,
          "end": 37.75
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "Ice water in the veins",
          "ko": "강심장이다, 냉정하고 침착하다",
          "type": "idiom"
        },
        {
          "term": "choke on camera",
          "ko": "(중요한 순간) 카메라 앞에서 긴장해 실수하다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 37.83,
      "end": 44.46,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "-Of course he can spell \"knaidel\". -Knaidel.",
          "start": 37.83,
          "end": 40.62
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at that face. Nothing. Nothing!",
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 44.46
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 45.42,
      "end": 52.34,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "He's 12 years old. Nothing!",
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 47.71
        },
        {
          "text": "This kid just won $30,000 cash. Nothing.",
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 52.34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 53.47,
      "end": 62.19,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "People ask, \"Where does that come from?\" Look at this kid's parents.",
          "start": 53.47,
          "end": 58.02
        },
        {
          "text": "Your son just won the Scripps National Spelling Bee.",
          "start": 58.1,
          "end": 62.19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 62.94,
      "end": 69.69,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Look at his brother. His brother is like, \"I'm fucked. I'm fucked.",
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 67.07
        },
        {
          "text": "The bar is way too high. I should kill myself.\"",
          "start": 67.15,
          "end": 69.69
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "The bar is way too high",
          "ko": "기준(눈높이)이 너무 높다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 69.78,
      "end": 74.91,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "People say, \"Where's Bobby Jindal from?\"",
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 71.86
        },
        {
          "text": "That's where he comes from. That is an Indian sociopath.",
          "start": 71.95,
          "end": 74.91
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "sociopath",
          "ko": "반사회적 인격장애자, 소시오패스",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 77.7,
      "end": 82.71,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I know what happens when I talk about this.",
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 80.04
        },
        {
          "text": "People say, \"Your parents don't love you.\"",
          "start": 80.12,
          "end": 82.71
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 82.79,
      "end": 89.63,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I think our parents love us. We have great fathers.",
          "start": 82.79,
          "end": 85.25
        },
        {
          "text": "I just think our fathers didn't download all the great dad software.",
          "start": 85.34,
          "end": 89.63
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 90.55,
      "end": 95.64,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "There are just a few apps missing.",
          "start": 90.55,
          "end": 92.76
        },
        {
          "text": "Birthdays aren't their thing.",
          "start": 93.72,
          "end": 95.64
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "Birthdays aren't their thing",
          "ko": "생일은 그들이 챙기는(관심 두는) 게 아니다",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 96.26,
      "end": 103.06,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Every immigrant father feels like if they brought you to the US...",
          "start": 96.26,
          "end": 99.93
        },
        {
          "text": "Happy Birthday.",
          "start": 101.35,
          "end": 103.06
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 103.14,
      "end": 108.44,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Starbucks, Wi-Fi, freeways, happy birthday.",
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 105.98
        },
        {
          "text": "No more birthdays. Go be president.",
          "start": 106.06,
          "end": 108.44
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 108.53,
      "end": 114.28,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "At an interview, this lady said, \"Describe your earliest birthday memory.\"",
          "start": 108.53,
          "end": 112.28
        },
        {
          "text": "I was like, \"Do I have to?\"",
          "start": 112.36,
          "end": 114.28
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 114.36,
      "end": 119.08,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So I'm six, I'm turning seven.",
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 116.37
        },
        {
          "text": "My dad wakes me up super early in the morning.",
          "start": 116.45,
          "end": 119.08
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 119.16,
      "end": 122.04,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hasan, get up!",
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 120.62
        },
        {
          "text": "Get in the Camry.\"",
          "start": 120.7,
          "end": 122.04
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 122.66,
      "end": 128.25,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The immigrant car of choice.",
          "start": 122.66,
          "end": 124.21
        },
        {
          "text": "We get in the Camry, we're driving from Davis to Sacramento.",
          "start": 124.75,
          "end": 128.25
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "the immigrant car of choice",
          "ko": "이민자들이 가장 선호하는 차",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 128.34,
      "end": 137.85,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "There's one mall in the entire area. Arden.",
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 130.88
        },
        {
          "text": "We get to this intersection, and I look to my left, and it's the one place every kid dreams about.",
          "start": 130.96,
          "end": 137.85
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "intersection",
          "ko": "교차로",
          "type": "word"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 137.93,
      "end": 141.68,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Toys 'R' Us.",
          "start": 137.93,
          "end": 139.56
        },
        {
          "text": "I was like, \"Oh, shit!",
          "start": 139.64,
          "end": 141.68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 141.77,
      "end": 147.44,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Dad saw the Toys 'R' Us catalog on my wall.",
          "start": 141.77,
          "end": 144.48
        },
        {
          "text": "He saw my vision board.",
          "start": 145.4,
          "end": 147.44
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "vision board",
          "ko": "목표·소망을 붙여 두는 보드",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 148.98,
      "end": 155.57,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "He saw the blue BMX bike I wanted. He's here to surprise me.",
          "start": 148.98,
          "end": 152.4
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn left. Turn left.",
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 155.57
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 155.66,
      "end": 163.29,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Turn... left.\"",
          "start": 155.66,
          "end": 158.24
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he turns right, and I'm like, \"Home Depot?",
          "start": 159.28,
          "end": 163.29
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 163.37,
      "end": 169.38,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "No!\"",
          "start": 163.37,
          "end": 165.96
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm like, \"Why are we here? Do you know what day it is?\"",
          "start": 166.04,
          "end": 169.38
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 169.46,
      "end": 173.34,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"It's Saturday.\"",
          "start": 169.46,
          "end": 170.5
        },
        {
          "text": "\"No, it's my birthday. Did you forget?\"",
          "start": 170.59,
          "end": 173.34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 173.42,
      "end": 179.47,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "He's like, \"Hasan, how could I forget that it's your birthday?",
          "start": 173.42,
          "end": 176.68
        },
        {
          "text": "That's why I brought you here.",
          "start": 177.14,
          "end": 179.47
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 180.05,
      "end": 190.06,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So you could pick the door handle for the bathroom.\"",
          "start": 180.05,
          "end": 182.89
        },
        {
          "text": "And I was like, \"Why don't you have me pick out the toilet?",
          "start": 184.56,
          "end": 190.06
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "pick out",
          "ko": "고르다, 골라내다",
          "type": "phrase"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 190.15,
      "end": 195.9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You are shitting on my dreams.\"",
          "start": 190.15,
          "end": 191.94
        },
        {
          "text": "I didn't say that. I would have gotten a slap. I wanted to say that.",
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 195.9
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
        {
          "term": "shitting on my dreams",
          "ko": "내 꿈을 짓밟다 (비속어)",
          "type": "idiom"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 195.99,
      "end": 196.24,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "That's when I realized",
          "start": 195.99,
          "end": 196.24
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
